<section>
  <div class="wrap {{ 'two two--top' if pics.length else 'narrow' }}">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Upper Secondary</p>
      <h2>The dinner party debate</h2>
      <p>Each Upper Secondary student chose a question and imagined a dinner party where famous people from history and today argue it out. On their posters they wrote what each guest says, in English and in that guest's voice, with the guests agreeing, disagreeing and answering each other.</p>
      <p>Napoleon and Abraham Lincoln argued about taxes and revolution, Einstein about artificial intelligence, and Dolly Parton about whether people are born to work together. Other tables took on an age limit for social media and whether parents should genetically enhance their children. At the showcase the students guided their parents through their debates, and one talked his grandfather through his.</p>
    </div>
    {% if pics.length %}<div>
      {% set collageWide = false %}{% set collageArt = false %}{% set collage2up = false %}{% set collageCredit = "" %}
      {% set collagePhotos = pics %}
      {% set collage2up = pics.length == 4 %}
      {% include "partials/collage.njk" %}
    </div>{% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

