<section id="primary">
  <div class="wrap {{ 'two two--top' if pics.length else 'narrow' }}">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Primary</p>
      <h2>How a plant grows</h2>
      <p>Ms. Solo began with a short introduction for the parents. Then our Primary students acted out how a plant grows. In paper costumes as the sun, the rain, the plants and the gardener, they spoke and sang their parts in English.</p>
      <p>Next came a quiz: families rolled a dice and read out the questions on the cards, and the children answered in English. To finish, families looked through the children's books, from spelling tests to the sentences they now write, and Ms. Solo talked with any parents who wanted a word about their child.</p>
      {# The class's Canva slides from the afternoon (Year 1 Showcase 1.pdf), saved as one picture per slide (33 MB down to 3.4 MB). #}
